    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289076</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……今の……
無理して戦わなくても、
逃げられたんじゃ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Uhh... Couldn't we
have just run away
from that one?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>先手必勝。
先にぶっ叩いた方が勝ちかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Strike while the iron's
hot." Whoever gets the
first hit in will win.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>にしては、ダオスに対しては
ずいぶん、おくてだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But you're always pretty
slow when it comes to
Dhaos, aren't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289504</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それはあいつの方だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, that's his fault.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289504</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あのバカ……私が近づくたびに、
あちこち飛ばしてくれちゃって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That idiot... Any time I try to
get close to him, he sends me
flying off to who-knows-where.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289628</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレには&lt;Rody&gt;がダオスと
会わずにすんで、ほっと
してるふうにも見えるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kind of looks to me like
you're relieved whenever you
don't reach him, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……かもね。
怖い相手と戦わずに
済んでほっとしてんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Maybe. It is kind of
a relief to not have to
fight such a scary enemy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふーん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289892</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、それでも君は
ダオスを追っているんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, even so, you
still keep chasing him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289968</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……心残りなんだよ、まだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I still have
some regrets.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290048</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>英雄になりそこねたからか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Cause you weren't able
to be one of the heroes?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、そういうことかな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, something
like that, maybe?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『英雄』か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Heroes," huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>少なくとも今の僕は、
そんな立派なものじゃないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The way I am now, I'm not
anything so impressive as that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>世界を守りたいって気持ちも
もちろんあった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I did want to protect
the world, too, of course.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、僕を突き動かしてたのは
ただの復讐心だったんだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But my real motive
was just revenge.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私も……
&lt;Cless&gt;さんと同じです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm the same...
The same as &lt;Cless&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私も……母を
ダオスに殺された
のですから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Because I, too...had a mother
who was killed by Dhaos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『英雄』とか『時空戦士』とか
そんな呼び名が時々、重荷なんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Being called a "Hero of
Time" or whatever is just a
burden to me, sometimes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、僕たちは、
みんなのその呼び声に
応えなくちゃいけない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, we still have to try to live
up to what people expect of us...
what they think of, and call us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、利用されてんの知ってて
騎士団を手伝ってんのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So is that why you help
the Knights even knowing
they're just using you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>利用しているのは、
僕も同じだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm using
them, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290988</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Cless&gt;さんも？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You are?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>僕は『英雄』と呼ばれるに
ふさわしい自分になるため、
彼らを利用してる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm using them as a stepping stone. They're
just a part of my journey, as I aim to
become worthy of being called a "hero."</EnglishText>
      <Notes>TL checkchanged feeling to duty but we arent sure</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291168</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まったく、&lt;Cless&gt;も&lt;Mint&gt;も
真面目すぎるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Man... &lt;Cless&gt;, &lt;Mint&gt;, you're
both way too honest.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291324</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>期待したい奴には勝手に
させとけばいいんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If people want to expect
something of you, that's
their own business.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_035&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレ……&lt;Cless&gt;さんも
&lt;Mint&gt;さんもがんばって
『英雄』やらなくてもいいと思う</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I think...you're putting way
more effort than you need to
into this whole "hero" thing.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291516</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_036&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291700</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや、違うかな……
今のふたりが、
嘘かマジかわかんねし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Or, I dunno... I don't really
know if you guys are the
real deal already or not.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291700</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_038&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……でも、なんか
あんまがんばんなくても、
ふたりはその……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...But, even if you don't
throw yourselves into it
like this, you're already kinda...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……あぁっ！
なんかうまく言えねー！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ah, dammit! I dunno
how to say it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;は自然体のままの
ふたりでも十分魅力的って
言いたいんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're trying to say they're
already charming just the way
they are, aren't you, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>291992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉっ……
今のでわかったのか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa... Yeah, I
think I get it now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_042&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしも……そう思います</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I...think so, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_043&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だって、&lt;Red&gt;トーティス村&lt;White&gt;の
皆さん、おふたりのこと
大好きみたいでしたから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I mean, everyone in
&lt;Red&gt;Totus Village&lt;White&gt; already
loves you two, don't they?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_044&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、なんにしてもだ。
ふたりとも片意地
張りすぎなんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, whatever the case.
You're both being way too
hard-headed about this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292332</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなに難しく
考えなくたって
いいと思うぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You don't have to
overthink everything
so much, you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292432</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_046&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君はちょい難しく
考えたほうがいいんじゃない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And maybe you should think things
through just a little more, hm?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292504</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_047&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どういう意味だよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell do you
mean by that!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ！　オ、オレ、なんか
&lt;Cless&gt;さんに
偉そうなこと言っちゃった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh! I-I didn't, like, come off
like I was talking down to
you or anything, did I, &lt;Cless&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292756</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_030_049&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや、ありがとう、&lt;Dio&gt;。
&lt;Mel&gt;も、それに&lt;Chester&gt;も</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No. Thank you, &lt;Dio&gt;.
And &lt;Mel&gt;, and &lt;Chester&gt;, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
